Haiku icons used by AzMail

The .hvif files in this folder are icons from the Haiku project's icon set and
from zuMi's icon set for Haiku, published at https://hvif-store.art under the
MIT License. Each file is named after the Material icon it replaces in AzMail;
the list below names the original icon, its author and its hvif-store.art id.

  mail.hvif  <- "E-Mail" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 384)
  reply.hvif  <- "Reply" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 286)
  reply_all.hvif  <- "Reply All" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 1171)
  forward.hvif  <- "Forward" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 281)
  delete.hvif  <- "Trash Empty" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 423)
  group.hvif  <- "Team" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 419)
  drive_file_move.hvif  <- "Move File" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 422)
  mark_email_read.hvif  <- "Mark Read" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 990)
  mark_email_unread.hvif  <- "Mark Unread" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 892)
  flag.hvif  <- "Mark Important" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 911)
  sync.hvif  <- "Send Receive" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 1145)
  refresh.hvif  <- "Refresh" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 923)
  inbox.hvif  <- "Mail Folder" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 271)
  all_inbox.hvif  <- "Mail Folder" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 271)
  drafts.hvif  <- "Document New" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 956)
  send.hvif  <- "Mail Send" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 1105)
  folder.hvif  <- "Folder" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 268)
  report.hvif  <- "Junk" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 920)
  calendar_month.hvif  <- "Calendar" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 861)
  contacts.hvif  <- "People" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 107)
  task_alt.hvif  <- "Task File" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 258)
  account_circle.hvif  <- "Person" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 242)
  person_add.hvif  <- "Website Register" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 438)
  manage_accounts.hvif  <- "Website Edit Profile" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 436)
  info.hvif  <- "Info" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 30)
  print.hvif  <- "Printer" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 391)
  settings.hvif  <- "Settings" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 1207)
  keyboard.hvif  <- "Keyboard" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 381)
  description.hvif  <- "OpenDocument Text File" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 260)
  picture_as_pdf.hvif  <- "Printer PDF" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 392)
  x.hvif  <- "Exit" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 1067)
  message.hvif  <- "New Mail File" by Haiku, Inc. (MIT, hvif-store.art id 237)
  exports.hvif  <- "Export" by zuMi (MIT, hvif-store.art id 798)

